["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"93. 離開字節、MiniMax的張前川，發出AGI對人類威脅的預警 PageRank PGC baby AGI UBI\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-02-20-zhangxiaojun-agi-是人类的最后一个发明-但-95-的公司在踩油门/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0671266ee01a3b9e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:07:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2025</span></div>\n<h2>AGI 是人類的最後一個發明，但 95% 的公司在踩油門</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">張前川把人類文明比作開出 1 萬公里的車，AGI 是最後一公里：前方可能是更寬的公路，也可能是懸崖。而絕大多數 AI 公司正在做的是瘋狂踩油門。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AGI</span><span class=\"tag\">內容分發</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"92. 和張亞勤院士聊，意識、壽命、機器人、生物智能和物種的延伸 RS2 corner case end-to-end world model\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-02-17-zhangxiaojun-张亚勤-信息智能五年到顶-人形机器人还要十年/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/af271912f6614eec-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">53:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2025</span></div>\n<h2>張亞勤：信息智能五年到頂，人形機器人還要十年</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他把 AGI 拆成信息、物理、生物三層：信息智能五年內達到人類水平，但那是大腦的智商；讀萬卷書仍不會游泳，物理智能才剛開場。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AGI</span><span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"91. 逐篇講解DeepSeek關鍵9篇論文及創新點——“勇敢者的遊戲” MoE MLA MTP FP8 PPO rule-based reward\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-02-11-zhangxiaojun-deepseek-用-2000-张卡训出-671b-模型-靠的是敢赌没人做过的技/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0e697ec31e81cd26-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">3:20:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2025</span></div>\n<h2>DeepSeek 用 2000 張卡訓出 671B 模型，靠的是敢賭沒人做過的技術</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">DeepSeek 的每一步創新都是被成本逼出來的：從 MoE 到 MLA 到 FP8 訓練，別人不敢在大規模上試的東西，他們試了，而且一次訓完沒回滾。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>17</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">DeepSeek</span><span class=\"tag\">大模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"90. 朱嘯虎又來了：中國現實主義AIGC故事的1週年連載 Scaling Law RL DAU PMF Capex\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-02-07-zhangxiaojun-朱啸虎改口-deepseek-让他快信-agi-了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cd200744fc07602d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2025</span></div>\n<h2>朱嘯虎改口：DeepSeek 讓他快信 AGI 了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一年前他說絕不投任何一家中國大模型公司，如今他說如果梁文鋒開放融資「我肯定會投」，價格已經不太重要，關鍵是參與見證人類 AGI 和 AI 意識的產生。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">開源</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"89. 逐句講解DeepSeek-R1、Kimi K1.5、OpenAI o1技術報告——“最優美的算法最乾淨” GRPO reward hacking PRM MCTS distillation curriculum sampling\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-02-04-zhangxiaojun-r1-最值钱的不是模型-是那个-aha-moment/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/acc6341cf0407e5d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:49:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2025</span></div>\n<h2>R1 最值錢的不是模型，是那個 aha moment</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">DeepSeek 把 O1 出的謎語第一個解開了：不用人教，模型自己在強化學習裡學會反思和糾錯。R1-Zero 比 R1 更乾淨，但 R1 才是能用的那個。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">強化學習</span><span class=\"tag\">後訓練</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"88. 和吳翼技術解讀OpenAI Operator：推理從抽象世界走向物理世界的開端 CUA GUI agent close loop system OS World\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-01-24-zhangxiaojun-operator-不是-o3-的延续-是推理伸向物理世界的第一只手/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/55d0a72f1e4b0469-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:12:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2025</span></div>\n<h2>Operator 不是 O3 的延續，是推理伸向物理世界的第一隻手</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI 2016 年做 Web Agent 失敗並裁掉二三十人，缺的是基座模型；十年後 Operator 把基座模型、人類數據和強化學習三件事湊齊，才讓推理從抽象文本走向視覺交互。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">強化學習</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"87. 對李想的3小時訪談（播客版）：宅男、AI、家庭、遊戲和天梯 VLA VLM MPI BLM DT\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-01-02-zhangxiaojun-李想-汽车是物理世界ai最大的应用-但l4门票要三样东西/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d61119d6a5d51c08-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:53:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2025</span></div>\n<h2>李想：汽車是物理世界AI最大的應用，但L4門票要三樣東西</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他把AI產品分三段：增強能力、成為助手、成為家人。今天連第一段都沒做好，所以真正的競爭還沒開始。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI產品</span><span class=\"tag\">智能駕駛</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"How NVIDIA&#x27;s Jensen Huang Wants to be Remembered CUDA Omniverse Cosmos transformer attention mechanism\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-01-01-ch-cleo-abram-黄仁勋-gpu-是时间机器-机器人将无处不在/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/00404ce6eac0bc76-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cleo Abram</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2025</span></div>\n<h2>黃仁勳：GPU 是時間機器，機器人將無處不在</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">NVIDIA 的核心賭注不是「造更快的芯片」，而是押注深度學習架構可以無限擴展，並且這個判斷二十年沒變過，才撐起了 CUDA 十年無回報的投入。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">NVIDIA</span><span class=\"tag\">算力</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Jensen Huang on GPUs - Computerphile CUDA Tensor Core NVLink Amdahl&#x27;s Law scale up / scale out AI RAN\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-01-01-ch-computerphile-黄仁勋-ai让芯片算力十年涨了一百万倍而非摩尔定律预测的百倍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bd0f3e4a826d44f3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">23:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Computerphile</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2025</span></div>\n<h2>黃仁勳：AI讓芯片算力十年漲了一百萬倍而非摩爾定律預測的百倍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">黃仁勳說預打包軟件曾把算力的進步死死按在摩爾定律的節奏裡，而CUDA讓算法、精度和芯片可以同時重新設計，過去十年算力因此漲了約一百萬倍。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">GPU</span><span class=\"tag\">算力</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"A Conversation with Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang | Global Conference 2025 token physical AI AI factory\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-01-01-ch-milken-institute-黄仁勋-ai不是替代it-而是在创造数字劳动力补上劳动力缺口/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d0f90f164b386af8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">29:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Milken Institute</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2025</span></div>\n<h2>黃仁勳：AI不是替代IT，而是在創造數字勞動力補上勞動力缺口</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">黃仁勳認為AI工廠生產的是「token」，本質是在人類面對勞動力短缺時新增一支數字勞動力，而不是簡單的下一代IT工具。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Nvidia</span><span class=\"tag\">AI基礎設施</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Neuralink Update, Summer 2025 BCI ASIC BPS hand knob neural non-stationarity\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-01-01-ch-neuralink-穿刺针成本从350美元降到15美元-植入正在变成流水线作业/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b9ed33b1bc91df13-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">59:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Neuralink</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2025</span></div>\n<h2>穿刺針成本從350美元降到15美元，植入正在變成流水線作業</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">過去一年裡 Neuralink 把機器人插入每根電極的時間從17秒壓到1.5秒，穿刺針組件成本從350美元砍到15美元，這才是比動畫演示更能說明進度的信號。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">腦機接口</span><span class=\"tag\">醫療科技</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Elon Musk talks SpaceX Starship&#x27;s potential to transform space exploration in new update Gigabay\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-01-01-ch-videofromspace-马斯克-火星自给自足不是建芯片厂-而是建造厂的能力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6c494a46353996b7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"V\"><span class=\"dur\">21:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">VideoFromSpace</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2025</span></div>\n<h2>馬斯克：火星自給自足不是建芯片廠，而是建造廠的能力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Starship的終極目標是讓火星城市能在地球補給斷絕後獨立存活，這要求的不只是工廠，而是整套能造工廠的工業體系，預估需運送至少百萬噸物資。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">SpaceX</span><span class=\"tag\">火星殖民</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Elon Musk delivers SpaceX update on Starship, Mars goals and more at Starbase RRR (Rapidly reusable, Reliable Rockets) hot staging orbital propellant transfer / orbital refilling gigabay\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-01-01-ch-videofromspace-马斯克给火星殖民定了时间表-明年末发射-只有五五开胜算/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fa738aa7fb1d28dc-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"V\"><span class=\"dur\">39:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">VideoFromSpace</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2025</span></div>\n<h2>馬斯克給火星殖民定了時間表：明年末發射，只有五五開勝算</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">星艦計劃明年年底發射無人火星任務，但軌道推進劑轉移這項從未實現的技術能否及時搞定，馬斯克自己說勝算只有五五開。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">SpaceX</span><span class=\"tag\">星艦</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Elon Musk speaks at Dubai&#x27;s World Government Summit Doge Grok 3\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-01-01-ch-yahoo-finance-马斯克称退休档案堆满宾州矿井-是政府效率低下的缩影/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1c75be476da28f1c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">36:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Yahoo Finance</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2025</span></div>\n<h2>馬斯克稱退休檔案堆滿賓州礦井，是政府效率低下的縮影</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美國聯邦退休審批靠人工填表、用礦井電梯運進地下礦洞存檔，數字化項目已搞了11年仍只做到字母評級的B——馬斯克用這個例子說明政府低效的根源是技術，不是單純的預算。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">政府效率</span><span class=\"tag\">Grok</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"86. 大模型季報年終特輯：和廣密預言LLM產品超越Google之路 Long Horizon Task MCP Data Wall Reward Model K-Lab\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2024-12-22-zhangxiaojun-下一个google不是搜索-是任务引擎/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1d93d02a587ff35f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:32:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2024</span></div>\n<h2>下一個Google不是搜索，是任務引擎</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">ChatGPT、Anthropic、Perplexity 形態各異，但都在爭奪同一件事：重新組織信息與任務。搜索和推薦融合成任務引擎，誰掌握 context 誰就贏。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">Agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"85. 與總統競選成員聊，總統候選人與美國敘事如何PMF？ Product Market Fit Voter Registration Early Voting Tracker Deregulation\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2024-12-15-zhangxiaojun-总统大选就是给候选人找-pmf-产品不行谁也救不了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1644e0aa04895839-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">52:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2024</span></div>\n<h2>總統大選就是給候選人找 PMF，產品不行誰也救不了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">大選團隊是短期內 scale up 最快的組織，但產品（候選人）已經定了，能做的只是把產品和整個國家的環境做 product market fit。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美國大選</span><span class=\"tag\">PMF</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"84. 融了近4億的AI創業者在幹嘛？豈凡超的第一次訪談 conditioned generation RAG PMF MVP Foundation Model\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2024-12-10-zhangxiaojun-模型公司终将消失-产品公司才刚开始/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1f116fd554543d82-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:44:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2024</span></div>\n<h2>模型公司終將消失，產品公司才剛開始</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">齊帆超認為模型本身沒法直接產生價值，將來不存在模型公司；他融了近4億卻主動放棄訓更大模型，轉而解決大模型輸出不確定性這個產品落地的最大卡點。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI應用</span><span class=\"tag\">創業</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"83. 黃仁勳和3萬億美元英偉達是如何煉成的？ CUDA Riva 128 pilot in charge Top5\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2024-12-04-zhangxiaojun-英伟达没有二号位-黄仁勋退休后谁来管60个人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/775b2d2a4ded4dbf-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:44:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2024</span></div>\n<h2>英偉達沒有二號位：黃仁勳退休後誰來管60個人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英偉達的戰略不是規劃出來的，是三個團隊兩個賽季、運送一整頭牛這些戰術被驗證後固定下來的；但公司至今沒有明顯的二號位。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">英偉達</span><span class=\"tag\">黃仁勳</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"82. 和以太坊Vitalik Buterin聊：LLM的權力、技術哲學觀與貓 Layer 2 Farcaster Warpcast Polymarket Worldcoin\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2024-11-25-zhangxiaojun-ai-是中心化的权力-crypto-是它的解药/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c8ee10748c810b71-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:08:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2024</span></div>\n<h2>AI 是中心化的權力，Crypto 是它的解藥</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Vitalik 說 AI 的權力來自算力和數據，最好的 AI 就是最大的 AI，天然走向中心化；Crypto 唯一的作用是解決人和人之間的信任問題，所以 AI 參與 Crypto 的遊戲，而不是反過來。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI</span><span class=\"tag\">Crypto</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"81. 和李開復聊聊：如果美國形成AGI霸權，我們應該怎麼辦？ veneer Service as Software TCPMF HBM\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2024-11-10-zhangxiaojun-第一个做出agi的必然是垄断者-中国只能走生态这条路/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7f3cfaffb1fad8fb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:39:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2024</span></div>\n<h2>第一個做出AGI的必然是壟斷者，中國只能走生態這條路</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">追求第一個碾壓對手的AGI，本質是商業霸權野心——他會用這個大腦發明手段維持壟斷。中國公司打不過這場燒錢遊戲，只能先把推理成本降下來，用生態當護城河。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AGI霸權</span><span class=\"tag\">推理成本</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"80. 和知乎周源聊，社會化編輯部、孤獨的悖論、AI與宿命 PMF LTV NPC Perplexity\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2024-10-31-zhangxiaojun-知乎的敌人不是抖音-是规模驱动的自己/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/efc635d64ccaa69d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:20:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2024</span></div>\n<h2>知乎的敵人不是抖音，是規模驅動的自己</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">周源復盤：上市後視頻、短內容兩次戰略回撤，根因是把社區當規模生意做；社區只能生態驅動，溢出式增長，不能擴列式增長。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>11</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">內容社區</span><span class=\"tag\">AI搜索</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"79. 特斯拉股價跌了，Uber卻漲了？漫談特斯拉Robotaxi大會 BOM CP / car partner Remote Assist option value 搖操作\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2024-10-13-zhangxiaojun-特斯拉发布会像年会-robotaxi-的故事讲给股东听/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4d92f23bc8afbb6e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">58:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2024</span></div>\n<h2>特斯拉發布會像年會：Robotaxi 的故事講給股東聽</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">這場發布會沒有講任何技術，更像給老股東開的年會。真正值錢的是它把車閒置時間變現的兩條路：當 Robotaxi，或當分布式算力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自動駕駛</span><span class=\"tag\">Robotaxi</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"78. 從蒸汽機到無人駕駛5｜談談自動駕駛創投過山車這8年 SPAC PS ratio Gartner 曲線\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2024-10-08-zhangxiaojun-自动驾驶创投八年-起步估值太高的公司几乎都死了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/26c9d4bb25a4059d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:14:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2024</span></div>\n<h2>自動駕駛創投八年：起步估值太高的公司幾乎都死了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">夢醒統計過，估值一億美金以上的非資源型前沿科技公司，好像還沒有很成功的案例。起步太高的公司會把錢花在維持賣相上，而不是猥瑣發育。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自動駕駛</span><span class=\"tag\">風險投資</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"77. 併購重組會興起嗎？和陸復斌聊他隱蔽做全球併購這5年 Two-Pizza Teams LBO CIFIUS AUM skin in the game\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2024-10-05-zhangxiaojun-他出价51亿买雅虎-输给了45亿的对手/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c0794e105e21caea-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:34:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2024</span></div>\n<h2>他出價51億買雅虎，輸給了45億的對手</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">陸復斌的offer比Apollo高6億美金，卻連一個答案都沒拿到。五年後對方當面告訴他：你沒有他們的高爾夫俱樂部會員。併購市場裡，價格之外還有一層看不見的門檻。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">併購</span><span class=\"tag\">出海</span>\n</div></div></a>"]